{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐感受描写不如X细密，尤其是逐小节出现的情绪变化、音色细节和微妙的心理转折，X更具体。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、加亮关键词和分时出现的感受更容易在听音乐时快速扫到，也更细致地贴合音乐变化。但Y把人物从受委屈而离开、怀念过去的亲近、害怕孤单，到最终不急着回头而选择继续生活的心理因果讲得更完整，尤其是每段之间的承接更自然。作为没读过原文的普通观众，我更容易通过Y理解这个人为什么这样想、为什么反复，以及最后为什么作出这样的选择，因此整体选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6a58a9e1-29a0-4d89-b452-fc2359ec1434", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T074441204548Z", "elapsed_seconds": 70.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:45:52.091177+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cefb4150f605b1e71c56d1d741e41349d76d54bc11dc73aabed4af0d3b7eba9e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py